#: data/maps/OldaleTown_PokemonCenter_1F/scripts.inc:40
msgctxt "OldaleTown_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_TrainersCanUsePC"
msgid ""
"That PC in the corner there is\n"
"for any POKéMON TRAINER to use.\p"
"Naturally, that means you're welcome\n"
"to use it, too.$"
msgstr ""
"角落里的那台电脑，\n"
"所有宝可梦训练家都可以使用。\p"
"当然了，\n"
"你也可以随便用哦。$"

#: data/maps/OldaleTown_PokemonCenter_1F/scripts.inc:46
msgctxt "OldaleTown_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_PokemonCentersAreGreat"
msgid ""
"POKéMON CENTERS are great!\p"
"You can use their services as much\n"
"as you like, and it's all for free.\l"
"You never have to worry!$"
msgstr ""
"宝可梦中心真是太棒了！\p"
"这里的服务想用多少次都行，\n"
"而且全部免费。\l"
"完全不用担心！$"

#: data/maps/OldaleTown_PokemonCenter_1F/scripts.inc:52
msgctxt "OldaleTown_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_WirelessClubNotAvailable"
msgid ""
"The POKéMON WIRELESS CLUB on\n"
"the second floor was built recently.\p"
"But they say they're still making\n"
"adjustments.$"
msgstr ""
"二楼的宝可梦无线俱乐部\n"
"是最近才建好的。\p"
"不过听说现在还在调整中。$"

#: data/maps/OldaleTown_PokemonCenter_1F/scripts.inc:58
msgctxt "OldaleTown_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_TradedInWirelessClub"
msgid ""
"The POKéMON WIRELESS CLUB on\n"
"the second floor was built recently.\p"
"I traded POKéMON right away.$"
msgstr ""
"二楼的宝可梦无线俱乐部\n"
"是最近才建好的。\p"
"我马上就去交换了宝可梦。$"
